===Etymology===
Perhaps from {{der|la|ine-pro|*h₁epi||at, near; on}}, whence also {{m|la|ob}}. Less likely from {{der|la|ine-pro|*h₃ep-||to work, toil; ability, force}}, whence also {{m|la|ops}} and {{m|la|opus}}.

